{"id":"0abc357ef7715d00","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-anal.md","title":"有效解析一级与余解析一级","display":"df-anal — 有效解析一级与余解析一级","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-anal","aliases":["20-df-anal"],"display":"df-anal — 有效解析一级与余解析一级","chapter":"supplement","section":"supplement.hyperarithmetic","source_kind":"legacy-supplement","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"既有解析一级定义的类型／绑定修复；书外补充","depends_on":["[[20-df-arith-real-relation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-anal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-anal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-anal — 有效解析一级与余解析一级"},{"key":"chapter","html":"supplement"},{"key":"section","html":"supplement.hyperarithmetic"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"legacy-supplement"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"既有解析一级定义的类型／绑定修复；书外补充"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"67ae4f0c8e4d1ac7\" href=\"?note=67ae4f0c8e4d1ac7\" title=\"20-df-arith-real-relation\">20-df-arith-real-relation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\ge1\">\\(k\\ge1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega^k\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega^k\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"67ae4f0c8e4d1ac7\" href=\"?note=67ae4f0c8e4d1ac7\" title=\"20-df-arith-real-relation\">20-df-arith-real-relation</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}anal}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\Sigma^1_{1,k}:=\\{\\{\\vec n:\\exists f\\in\\omega^\\omega\\ ((\\vec n,f)\\in R)\\}:R\\in\\mathscr A_{k,1}\\},\\\\\n\\Pi^1_{1,k}:=\\{\\omega^k\\setminus A:A\\in\\Sigma^1_{1,k}\\},\\qquad\n\\Delta^1_{1,k}:=\\Sigma^1_{1,k}\\cap\\Pi^1_{1,k},\\\\\n\\Sigma^1_1:=\\Sigma^1_{1,1},\\quad\\Pi^1_1:=\\Pi^1_{1,1},\\quad\\Delta^1_1:=\\Delta^1_{1,1}.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}anal}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\Sigma^1_{1,k}:=\\{\\{\\vec n:\\exists f\\in\\omega^\\omega\\ ((\\vec n,f)\\in R)\\}:R\\in\\mathscr A_{k,1}\\},\\\\\n\\Pi^1_{1,k}:=\\{\\omega^k\\setminus A:A\\in\\Sigma^1_{1,k}\\},\\qquad\n\\Delta^1_{1,k}:=\\Sigma^1_{1,k}\\cap\\Pi^1_{1,k},\\\\\n\\Sigma^1_1:=\\Sigma^1_{1,1},\\quad\\Pi^1_1:=\\Pi^1_{1,1},\\quad\\Delta^1_1:=\\Delta^1_{1,1}.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是 lightface 一级定义，旧稿只列出的三个集合族即此范围。函数量词必须在定义 A 的成员关系中，而不是放在集合构造的未绑定条件外。第 14 章实际为 Banach–Mazur 博弈，解析层级不是其章节内容。</p>\n<p>来源：既有解析一级定义的类型／绑定修复；书外补充。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-arith-real-relation","status":"resolved","id":"67ae4f0c8e4d1ac7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-arith-real-relation]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-arith-real-relation","status":"resolved","id":"67ae4f0c8e4d1ac7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-arith-real-relation]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\omega^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}anal}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\Sigma^1_{1,k}:=\\{\\{\\vec n:\\exists f\\in\\omega^\\omega\\ ((\\vec n,f)\\in R)\\}:R\\in\\mathscr A_{k,1}\\},\\\\\n\\Pi^1_{1,k}:=\\{\\omega^k\\setminus A:A\\in\\Sigma^1_{1,k}\\},\\qquad\n\\Delta^1_{1,k}:=\\Sigma^1_{1,k}\\cap\\Pi^1_{1,k},\\\\\n\\Sigma^1_1:=\\Sigma^1_{1,1},\\quad\\Pi^1_1:=\\Pi^1_{1,1},\\quad\\Delta^1_1:=\\Delta^1_{1,1}.\n\\end{gathered}","display":true}],"bytes":1367,"backlinks":[{"id":"b65e5f1831d9a0f7","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-hyp]]；see [[20-df-anal]]。"},{"id":"e9155fcdafc74583","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-anal]]；see [[20-df-tree]]；see [[20-df-recursive]]；see [[20-df-finite-sequence-code]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。"},{"id":"8bf8e68601202588","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-kleene-O]]；see [[20-df-anal]]；see [[20-df-mred]]。"},{"id":"a6caa184e5759034","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-ck]]；see [[20-df-computable-wellorder]]；see [[20-df-anal]]。"},{"id":"1f0cef53db54a686","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-hyp]]；see [[20-df-anal]]。"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-439","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-anal]] — 章 supplement；直接提供者 1 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-439","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-anal]]"}],"outgoing":["67ae4f0c8e4d1ac7"]}